## 2. Cloudflare R2 - ✅ WORKING PERFECTLY

### Bucket Verification

| Test | Result |
|---|---|
| Public URL accessible | ✅ `pub-9081bce8ff6b4db5b4403ca7adae7b80.r2.dev` |
| Thumbnail delivery | ✅ 200 OK, `image/webp` |
| Cache headers | ✅ `public, max-age=31536000, immutable` |
| Thumb sizes | ✅ 1.7-5.1 KB (was 4-5 MB = **~99.9% reduction**) |
| Medium sizes | ✅ 9.6 KB |

### Sample Objects Verified

```
OK [200] food-images/v2/thumb/1.webp  - 1.7KB  ✅
OK [200] food-images/v2/thumb/10.webp - 5.1KB  ✅
OK [200] food-images/v2/thumb/20.webp - 1.9KB  ✅
